---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-rule py-6 mt-12 no-print">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-sm text-ink-soft">
    <p>
      <span class="font-serif font-semibold text-ink">Rebirth Manual</span> — the ladder from survival to industry.
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs">
      © {year} · Print it. Copy it. Teach it. Knowledge is the only resource that can't be scavenged.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
